>> a := Mndandanda ← Chinthu ; Zoona ; Zabodza ; Buliyani ; 1 ; Nambala ; ['Str'] ; Malemba ; { ['Empty']. }.
Zotuluka lembani: (a chiwerengero-cha-zinthu), mzere-watsopano.
{ :i
	Zotuluka lembani: 
	['a '] + 
	((a ? i) mtundu) +
	([' \‘this\’ '] this: (a ? i))  +
	[' is '] +
	(((a ? i) Palibe?) ichi: [''] kapena-icho: ['NOT']) + 
	[' Nil.'],
	mzere-watsopano.
} × (a chiwerengero-cha-zinthu).
Zotuluka lembani: ['but.. Nil is.. '] + ((Palibe Palibe?) ichi: ['certainly NIL!'] kapena-icho: ['not NIL??']), mzere-watsopano.